=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward tls -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 24.04,$
# whose logger is rsyslog. hardn's file forwards over TLS to the$
# name the server's certificate carries, checked against$
# hardn.yml's CA file.$
$
# Log Forwarding ###############################################$
$
  [+] Log Forwarding       Configured logs.example.net:6514 TLS$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
   -  Server               logs.example.net:6514$
  [+] Protocol             TLS$
   -  CA File              /etc/ssl/lab-ca.pem$
  [+] Connection           Open$
   -  File                 /etc/rsyslog.d/60-hardn-forward.conf$
   -  Set by               hardn$
   -  hardn.yml            logs.example.net:6514 TLS$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Stop forwarding      Undo hardn's change$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

